<title>USA: Paine Webber files shelf for $500 mln debt.</title>
<headline>Paine Webber files shelf for $500 mln debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paine Webber Group Inc said Thursday it filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for $500 million in debt securities.  </p>
<p>The company said net proceeds will be invested by the Trust in junior subordinated debentures. The proceeds from the issuance of the debentures will be used by the company for general corporate purposes, the filing said.</p>
</text>
